# Runtime / per-clone state — never commit.
# `bd` rewrites these on every command, so tracking them caused cross-session
# merge conflicts and contributed to the divergent-branches deadlock that
# wedged the daemon on 2026-05-16.
#
# Source of truth lives in `issues.jsonl` (committed). Everything below is
# derived state that gets rebuilt by `bd init` + `bd import`.

beads.db
beads.db-shm
beads.db-wal
beads.db-journal
.local_version
.sync.lock
sync-state.json
last-touched
daemon.pid
daemon.log
bd.sock
interactions.jsonl

# Post-mortem artifacts from DB-corruption recoveries — keep on disk for
# forensics, never commit.
*.corrupt-*
